       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SORTSTEP.
      * Stand-in for the DFSORT step of TRANREPT.jcl:
      *  SORT FIELDS=(TRAN-CARD-NUM,A)
      *  INCLUDE COND=(TRAN-PROC-DT,GE,START,AND,TRAN-PROC-DT,LE,END)
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SORT-IN ASSIGN TO SORTIN ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT SORT-OUT ASSIGN TO SORTOUT ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT SORTWK ASSIGN TO "SORTWK".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD SORT-IN.
       01 IN-REC PIC X(350).
       FD SORT-OUT.
       01 OUT-REC PIC X(350).
       SD SORTWK.
       01 WK-REC.
          05 FILLER PIC X(262).
          05 WK-CARD PIC X(16).
          05 FILLER PIC X(26).
          05 WK-PROC-DT PIC X(10).
          05 FILLER PIC X(36).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 START-DT PIC X(10).
       01 END-DT PIC X(10).
       01 EOF-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT START-DT FROM ENVIRONMENT "PARM_START_DATE".
           ACCEPT END-DT FROM ENVIRONMENT "PARM_END_DATE".
           SORT SORTWK ON ASCENDING KEY WK-CARD
             WITH DUPLICATES IN ORDER
             INPUT PROCEDURE SELECT-RECS
             GIVING SORT-OUT.
           STOP RUN.
       SELECT-RECS.
           OPEN INPUT SORT-IN.
           PERFORM UNTIL EOF-FLAG = "Y"
             READ SORT-IN AT END MOVE "Y" TO EOF-FLAG
               NOT AT END
                 MOVE IN-REC TO WK-REC
                 IF WK-PROC-DT >= START-DT AND WK-PROC-DT <= END-DT
                    RELEASE WK-REC
                 END-IF
             END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           CLOSE SORT-IN.
